<p>we have not yet received your confirmation of our order{% if bestellnummer %} <b>{{ bestellnummer }}</b>{% endif %} for <b>{{ kunde }}</b>{% if auftragsdatum %} dated {{ auftragsdatum | datum_de }}{% endif %}. The delivery is scheduled as a fixed date for <b>{{ liefertag | datum_de }}</b>{% if verladedatum %}, loading planned for {{ verladedatum | datum_de }}{% endif %}.</p>
